{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17937","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 十 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮暗来客去，羣嚣各收声。\n悠悠偃宵寂，斖斖抱秋明。\n世累忽进虑，外忧遂侵诚。\n强怀张不满，弱念缺已盈。\n诘屈避语穽，冥茫触心兵。\n败虞千金弃，得比寸草荣。\n知耻足爲勇，晏然谁汝令。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}